:: Story Stylesheet [stylesheet]
/* A zipped Harlowe story with files of its own, for Inkventure's tests (MIT; story S1.11). Built into lamp-files.zip
   by scripts/fixtures/build-twine.ts, with img/lamp.png, fonts/lamp.woff2 (Literata, OFL), css/lamp.css (linked,
   with a url() to the picture) and js/lamp.js (linked). Small enough to be cached with its files (< 512 KB). */
@font-face {
  font-family: "LampFont";
  src: url("fonts/lamp.woff2") format("woff2"), url("fonts/missing.ttf") format("truetype");
}
.lamp-title {
  font-family: "LampFont", serif;
}

:: Landing Stage
<span class="lamp-title">The Lamp at Saltmere</span>

<img id="lamp" src="./img/lamp.png" alt="A lamp">

<span class="lamp-styled">The lighthouse above the harbour is dark.</span>

<img id="late" alt="The lamp, later">
<script>setTimeout(function () { document.getElementById('late').setAttribute('src', 'img/lamp.png'); }, 0);</script>

[[Light the lamp->Lit]]

:: Lit
The lamp is lit.
